# --- Secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Personal listening data ---
# CLAUDE.md: streaming history stays local, stays gitignored, is never logged
# or committed.
data/
*.zip
Streaming_History_*.json
my_spotify_data*/

